{'symbol': 'CPRT', 'date': '2019-11-19 22:30:00', 'title': 'COPART, INC. REPORTS EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE FIRST QUARTER ENDED OCTOBER 31, 2019', 'text': 'COPART, INC. ANNOUNCED EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE FIRST QUARTER ENDED OCTOBER 31, 2019. FOR THE FIRST QUARTER, THE COMPANY ANNOUNCED TOTAL REVENUE WAS USD 554.424 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 461.368 MILLION A YEAR AGO. OPERATING INCOME WAS USD 205.391 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 151.440 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET INCOME WAS USD 218.180 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 114.083 MILLION A YEAR AGO. BASIC EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 0.94 COMPARED TO USD 0.49 A YEAR AGO. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 0.91 COMPARED TO USD 0.47 A YEAR AGO.'}